{"id":"u-83cc044e-914f-44c9-b13a-775527e53af8","src":"community","title":"5/3/1(Bench Focused)","author":"Kade W.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/XpZb41-531bench-focused","desc":"Elevate your bench press with this modified 5/3/1 BBB designed for serious lifters. Comprising 16 training days, you'll engage in a variety of exercises including paused bench presses, overhead presses, and targeted accessory work to build strength and muscle. It has all the same style and volume as the original 5/3/1 but with extra bench work for lifters who need extra frequency and volume for bench.\n\n\nI designed this program to work for me, and you will most likley be differnt. Feel free to switch out the secondary Variation, for BBB to fit your individual weaknesses that you need to work on. For example I have pause bench and Squat and roll. Maybe you need front squat, close grip bench, and deficit deadlifts. \n\nOn ever 3rd set of your main lifts it should be an Amrap and you should only go up in weight if you get more than what is asked for reps of that set\n\nFor example on week 1 it is 3x5 on your 3rd set, you should be able to get 7-10 reps before you add weight next cycle if you manage that. You will want to increase your TM by 5 lbs on bench or 10lbs on squat and deads.\n\nEverything in the program is submaximal so you want to take you true 1rm at 90% and put that in as your 1rm for this program","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":7,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-07T05:01:35.363Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Bench Accessory day","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Paused)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":5}],"note":"I have pause bench here, however use whatever Variation for your weak point"},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":65,"x":3}]},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":5}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)",